---
title: 幻梦 QQ Bot — Pipeline 14-Step Sequence
config:
  theme: dark
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor QQ as QQ Group
    participant WS as NapCat WS
    participant DISP as Dispatcher
    participant PIPE as Pipeline
    participant JUDGE as Judge Module
    participant J_CHEAP as Cheap LLM
    participant J_DEEP as Judge LLM
    participant LLM as Reply LLM
    participant MEM as Memory
    participant FAV as Fav System
    participant SRCH as Search
    participant SEND as Sender

    QQ->>WS: Send message
    WS->>DISP: JSON Event

    Note over DISP: Pre-processing
    DISP->>DISP: 0. Whitelist check
    DISP->>DISP: 1. Record recall buffer
    DISP->>DISP: 2. Record stats counter
    DISP->>DISP: 3. Image async recognition
    DISP->>DISP: 4. @Username resolve
    DISP->>DISP: 5. Quoted message fetch
    DISP->>DISP: 6. Error report detect

    DISP->>PIPE: process_message()

    rect rgb(30, 30, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step -1: Preset Intercept
        PIPE->>PIPE: Check {{...}} injection
    end

    rect rgb(30, 30, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 0.5: Quote injection
        PIPE->>PIPE: Inject quoted text
    end

    rect rgb(30, 40, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 1: Context Write
        PIPE->>PIPE: append_to_context()
    end

    rect rgb(30, 40, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 2: Command Intercept
        PIPE->>PIPE: Match . or /#
        alt Command matched
            PIPE->>PIPE: handle_command() COMMAND_MAP
            PIPE->>SEND: Return result
            SEND->>QQ: Reply
        end
    end

    rect rgb(40, 30, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 3: Reply Decision
        PIPE->>JUDGE: should_respond()
        alt @mentions
            JUDGE-->>PIPE: Respond (forced)
        else at_only mode
            JUDGE-->>PIPE: Skip (no @)
        else normal
            par Quick Filter
                JUDGE->>JUDGE: should_quick_reject()
            and LLM Judge (parallel)
                JUDGE->>J_CHEAP: judge_should_reply_cheap()
                J_CHEAP-->>JUDGE: 0 or 1
            and Interest Judge (parallel)
                JUDGE->>J_DEEP: judge_interest()
                J_DEEP-->>JUDGE: 0~10
            end
            JUDGE-->>PIPE: Reply or Skip
        end
    end

    rect rgb(30, 30, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 3.5: Spam Guard
        PIPE->>PIPE: check_and_record()
    end

    rect rgb(30, 40, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 4: Auto Search
        PIPE->>SRCH: auto_search_if_needed()
        opt needs search
            SRCH->>SRCH: DuckDuckGo search
            SRCH->>SRCH: Cache result
            SRCH-->>PIPE: Search result text
        end
    end

    rect rgb(40, 30, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 5: Memory + Fav + Time
        PIPE->>MEM: get_top_memories()
        MEM-->>PIPE: Top 5 relevant
        PIPE->>FAV: get_fav()
        FAV-->>PIPE: Fav value
        PIPE->>PIPE: Current time injection
    end

    rect rgb(50, 30, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 6: LLM Generate
        PIPE->>LLM: generate_multi_reply()
        Note over LLM: System + Anchor + History + Current
        LLM-->>PIPE: sentences + fav_change
    end

    rect rgb(30, 30, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 7: Context Writeback
        PIPE->>PIPE: append_to_context(reply)
    end

    rect rgb(30, 40, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 8: Task Schedule
        PIPE->>PIPE: Cancel old send task
        PIPE->>SEND: send_sentences() async
    end

    rect rgb(40, 30, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 9: Fav Update
        PIPE->>FAV: update_fav(fav_change)
    end

    rect rgb(30, 30, 60)
        Note over PIPE: Step 10: Auto Memory
        PIPE->>MEM: maybe_save_memory()
        opt 10min cooldown passed
            MEM->>LLM: summarize_conversation()
            LLM-->>MEM: 80-char summary
            MEM->>MEM: append_memory()
        end
    end

    Note over SEND: Multi-sentence delivery
    SEND->>SEND: 2~4s random delay
    SEND->>SEND: Send sentence 1
    SEND->>QQ: CQ message 1

    SEND->>SEND: 2~4s random delay
    SEND->>SEND: Send sentence 2
    SEND->>QQ: CQ message 2

    SEND->>SEND: 2~4s random delay
    SEND->>SEND: Send sentence 3
    SEND->>QQ: CQ message 3
